---
description: Supabase full DB schema and definition read access
alwaysApply: false
---

When table schema and definition is needed and there is no access to mcp (meaning database is needed for schema read-only), make sure to update the src/integrations/supabase/types.ts file by running:

npx supabase gen types typescript --project-id htbkflogiaxswzpxtsoz > src/integrations/supabase/types.ts

After running this command, you can view the full updated database schema in:

src/integrations/supabase/types.ts

Note that when only schema definition is needed, it's better to use this method even if mcp is available since it's faster.
